      "line": 11,
      "start": 11,
      "heading": "Dependencies",
      "text": "**Lombok is not on the classpath.** Never use it (`@RequiredArgsConstructor`, `@Data`, `@Builder`, etc.).",
      "id": "skill/spring-boot-conventions/lombok-is-not-on-the-classpath",
      "cases": [
        "spring-controller-follows-conventions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "skill/spring-boot-conventions",
      "source": "skills/spring-boot-conventions/SKILL.md",
      "line": 14,
      "start": 14,
      "heading": "DTOs",
      "text": "Request and response shapes are Java `record`s, grouped in a `<Feature>Dtos` holder class (e.g. `ModerationDtos.ListingQueueItem`).",
      "id": "skill/spring-boot-conventions/request-and-response-shapes-are-java",
      "cases": [
        "spring-request-dtos-are-validated-records"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "skill/spring-boot-conventions",
      "source": "skills/spring-boot-conventions/SKILL.md",
      "line": 15,
      "start": 15,
      "heading": "DTOs",
      "text": "Validate request bodies with `jakarta.validation` (`@Valid`, `@NotBlank`, `@Positive`).",
      "id": "skill/spring-boot-conventions/validate-request-bodies-with-jakarta-validation",
      "cases": [
        "spring-request-dtos-are-validated-records"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "skill/spring-boot-conventions",
      "source": "skills/spring-boot-conventions/SKILL.md",
      "line": 18,
      "start": 18,
      "heading": "Controllers",
      "text": "`@RestController` + `@RequestMapping(\"/api/<area>\")`. Thin: parse/validate input, call one service method, wrap the result.",
      "id": "skill/spring-boot-conventions/restcontroller-requestmapping-api-area-thin-parse",
      "cases": [
        "spring-controller-follows-conventions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "skill/spring-boot-conventions",
      "source": "skills/spring-boot-conventions/SKILL.md",
      "line": 19,
      "start": 19,
      "heading": "Controllers",
      "text": "Every response is wrapped: `ApiResponse.ok(body)` or `ApiResponse.ok(items, PageMeta.of(page, size, total))` for lists. Never return raw entities or bare lists.",
      "id": "skill/spring-boot-conventions/every-response-is-wrapped-apiresponse-ok",
      "cases": [
        "spring-controller-follows-conventions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "skill/spring-boot-conventions",
      "source": "skills/spring-boot-conventions/SKILL.md",
      "line": 20,
      "start": 20,
      "heading": "Controllers",
      "text": "Pagination is 1-based `page` and `size` query params. Clamp: `int pageNo = Math.max(page, 1); int pageSize = Math.clamp(size, 1, MAX_PAGE_SIZE);` with `MAX_PAGE_SIZE = 100` as a `private static final` constant.",
      "id": "skill/spring-boot-conventions/pagination-is-1-based-page",
      "cases": [
        "spring-controller-follows-conventions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "skill/spring-boot-conventions",
      "source": "skills/spring-boot-conventions/SKILL.md",
      "line": 23,
      "start": 23,
      "heading": "Services",
      "text": "Business rules and authorization checks live in the service, even when `SecurityConfig` already gates the route (\"two locks on the door\").",
      "id": "skill/spring-boot-conventions/business-rules-and-authorization-checks-live",
      "cases": [
        "spring-service-owns-rules-and-errors"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "skill/spring-boot-conventions",
      "source": "skills/spring-boot-conventions/SKILL.md",
      "line": 24,
      "start": 24,
      "heading": "Services",
      "text": "Services return records or small result types, never `Map<String, Object>`.",
      "id": "skill/spring-boot-conventions/services-return-records-or-small-result",
      "cases": [
        "spring-service-owns-rules-and-errors"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "skill/spring-boot-conventions",
      "source": "skills/spring-boot-conventions/SKILL.md",
      "line": 27,
      "start": 27,
      "heading": "Errors",
      "text": "Throw domain exceptions; a `@RestControllerAdvice` handler maps them to `ApiResponse.error(...)`. Do not try/catch in controllers.",
      "id": "skill/spring-boot-conventions/throw-domain-exceptions-a-restcontrolleradvice-handler",
      "cases": [
        "spring-service-owns-rules-and-errors"
      ]
    },
